<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">The Neighbourhood</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.200"><translations/><songwriters><songwriter>Cecil Bernardy</songwriter><songwriter>Jeremy Freedman</songwriter><songwriter>Jesse®</songwriter><songwriter>Jono Dorr</songwriter><songwriter>Karim Kharbouch</songwriter><songwriter>Michael Margott</songwriter><songwriter>Zachary Abels</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:54.48"><div begin="00:18.31" end="00:34.031" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="00:18.31" end="00:21.666" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1">Just got cheated on, no, it's not my day</p><p begin="00:21.666" end="00:25.801" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1">That's not my bitch, not my girl, she's not my babe</p><p begin="00:25.801" end="00:30.577" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1">My stomach's in pain, I hope I don't throw up all over what you told</p><p begin="00:30.577" end="00:34.031" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1">But it hurts me to know</p></div><div begin="00:34.031" end="00:50.231" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="00:34.031" end="00:37.965" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1">#icanteven, #icanteven believe what you did to me</p><p begin="00:37.965" end="00:42.114" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1">You can't even, you can't even say I'm overreacting</p><p begin="00:42.114" end="00:45.96" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1">#icanteven, can't even hear your sigh</p><p begin="00:45.96" end="00:50.231" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1">Shame on me, you fooled me twice</p></div><div begin="00:55.074" end="01:05.832" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="00:55.074" end="01:00.362" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1">And you said I wasn't just like anyone, like</p><p begin="01:01.337" end="01:05.832" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1">But you treated me just like everyone, like everyone else</p></div><div begin="01:05.59" end="01:27.13" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="01:05.59" end="01:07.613" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1">You like to say that you're right</p><p begin="01:07.613" end="01:10.639" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1">Did it make you feel bad when you cheated on your man last night?</p><p begin="01:10.639" end="01:13.748" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1">Did I even ever cross your mind?</p><p begin="01:13.748" end="01:16.779" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1">You like to say that you're right</p><p begin="01:16.461" end="01:19.462" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1">Did it make you feel bad when you cheated on your man last night?</p><p begin="01:19.462" end="01:22.423" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1">Did I even ever cross your mind?</p><p begin="01:22.423" end="01:24.52" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1">You like to say that you're right</p><p begin="01:24.52" end="01:27.13" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1">You like to say that you're right</p></div><div begin="01:28.504" end="01:53.741" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="01:28.504" end="01:30.386" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1">Drop head with a time hoodie on me</p><p begin="01:30.386" end="01:32.529" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1">Bought a hunnid chains, now the bitches all late</p><p begin="01:32.529" end="01:34.44" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1">Walk by the crib, smell the kitchen all stanky</p><p begin="01:34.44" end="01:36.562" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1">Floor seats, four quarter, spend a quarter on the link</p><p begin="01:36.562" end="01:38.769" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1">Ridin' through Philly, Meek Milly never lost</p><p begin="01:38.769" end="01:40.785" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1">Still ridin' through the strip, catchin' licks from my dog</p><p begin="01:40.785" end="01:43.844" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1">Thirty for the whole, fifteen for the half, you can break it down</p><p begin="01:43.844" end="01:45.083" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1">Come and see me with that bear</p><p begin="01:45.083" end="01:47.382" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1">Shorty fell in love with a young, rich ****</p><p begin="01:47.382" end="01:49.131" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1">Blunt full of smoke and a cup full of liquor</p><p begin="01:49.589" end="01:51.933" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1">Say what I mean and I mean what I say, baby</p><p begin="01:51.933" end="01:53.741" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1">Silk sheets, I be slippin' off the bed, baby</p></div><div begin="01:53.984" end="02:10.266" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="01:53.984" end="01:57.604" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1">#icanteven, #icanteven believe what you did to me</p><p begin="01:57.604" end="02:02.232" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1">You can't even, you can't even say I'm overreacting</p><p begin="02:02.232" end="02:06.1" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1">#icanteven, can't even hear your sigh</p><p begin="02:06.1" end="02:10.266" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1">Shame on me, you fooled me twice</p></div><div begin="02:15.161" end="02:25.883" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="02:15.161" end="02:19.116" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1">And you said I wasn't just like anyone, like</p><p begin="02:21.216" end="02:25.883" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1">But you treated me just like everyone, like everyone else</p></div><div begin="02:25.686" end="02:47.174" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="02:25.686" end="02:28.042" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1">You like to say that you're right</p><p begin="02:28.042" end="02:31.085" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1">Did it make you feel bad when you cheated on your man last night?</p><p begin="02:31.085" end="02:34.159" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1">Did I even ever cross your mind?</p><p begin="02:34.159" end="02:36.311" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1">You like to say that you're right</p><p begin="02:36.311" end="02:39.213" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1">Did it make you feel bad when you cheated on your man last night?</p><p begin="02:39.213" end="02:42.43" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1">Did I even ever cross your mind?</p><p begin="02:42.43" end="02:44.496" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1">You like to say that you're right</p><p begin="02:44.496" end="02:47.174" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1">You like to say that you're right</p></div></body></tt>
